<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Concept scheme defining the discrete units of the content plane (e.g., character, space, time) determined by a semantic constraint. Expected as the range value of desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit."@en .
